    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "All Rhodes Island Spec Ops Team Amiya hands, as per our plan, we will work with the Self-Salvation Corps and launch an ambush on the Londinium Defense Force's command tower."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We have only one objective: obtain the message logs from the defense system about the Sarkaz supply line."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "These messages will determine the success or failure of our entire Londinium operation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "And that's... even if we most likely can no longer stop Theresis from declaring war on the dukes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But if we get our hands on this information, we'll have a chance to slow the pace of the war and reduce the sacrifices that come with it to a minimum."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "We may have come well-prepared, but we need to expect the unexpected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "All of us know in our hearts that, in the coming war, each battle will be more difficult than the last."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#21$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But we came all this way for the same, unshakable goal."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It's time to keep going."
    },
