    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "........"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Doctor, I know you're worried about me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I can't say for sure that I'm ready... but ever since we left Sudean, I've been thinking what it will be like to see her again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "If she stands opposite us, I want to know why. I want to feel... everything that she feels."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_394_1#19$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But just as I told the operators, I will never forget why we came here in the first place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I understand very well that the future of the Sarkaz and the whole world that Theresa hoped for is slipping further and further away."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It's exactly the future that I, Dr. Kal'tsit, and all the operators who came to Londinium with us hope for."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "For that, we are prepared to face anything, and we will fight each battle like it is our last."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
