    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
        "text": "The Sarkaz army has been quick to mobilize lately."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "Yes, Lt. Colonel."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.5
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "Everyone has been saying... saying..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
        "text": "Saying what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "They've been saying that the Sarkaz are going to strike the dukes' forces soon. When that happens, they will throw us onto the battlefield as their cannon fodder."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "My apologies, Lt. Colonel. I've spoken out of turn."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
        "text": "No, I don't blame you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "We all trust you, sir. We all know how difficult it is to negotiate with the Sarkaz... but you've done it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "All these years, it was you who kept us safe."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "Even the time the Duke of Stafford revolted. If it wasn't for how accurate your judgment was, I would've been killed long ago by the rebels' cannonfire!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "You saved us time and again, and you protected this city from all sorts of conspiracies."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "As long as you're behind the decision, not one of us will question it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
        "text": "...I know that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_649_1#6$1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_408_1#1$1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lt. Colonel Lettou",
        "text": "It's precisely because I know that..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
