            "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "You're Victorian, aren't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_241"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "...I am."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "Twenty thousand Defense Forces men are stationed across the city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "Aside from those who were killed or captured, every last one of them is bound to the land they stand on by the same order, becoming an accessory to Sarkaz crimes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "There is no way you are not aware that the Sarkaz will soon be launching a war on all of Victoria."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "When that time comes, will you still stand with the Sarkaz against your own friends and family?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_241"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_401_1#6$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "Perhaps all you want is to survive. But you are not Sarkaz. You will never truly earn their trust. Once the war begins in earnest, they could abandon you at any moment."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_241"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_401_1#1$1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "I can see your hesitation. In the end, you are only footmen. It is the man who gives your orders, not you, who we must confront."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Clovisia",
        "text": "So, stand aside."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_241"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Victorian Soldier",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_241"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
